   1:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c **** /**
   2:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   * @file    system_stm32g4xx.c
   4:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   * @author  MCD Application Team
   5:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   * @brief   CMSIS Cortex-M4 Device Peripheral Access Layer System Source File
   6:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *
   7:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *   This file provides two functions and one global variable to be called from
   8:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *   user application:
   9:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *      - SystemInit(): This function is called at startup just after reset and
  10:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *                      before branch to main program. This call is made inside
  11:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *                      the "startup_stm32g4xx.s" file.
  12:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *
  13:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *      - SystemCoreClock variable: Contains the core clock (HCLK), it can be used
  14:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *                                  by the user application to setup the SysTick
  15:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *                                  timer or configure other parameters.
  16:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *
  17:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *      - SystemCoreClockUpdate(): Updates the variable SystemCoreClock and must
  18:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *                                 be called whenever the core clock is changed
  19:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *                                 during program execution.
  20:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *
  21:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *   After each device reset the HSI (16 MHz) is used as system clock source.
  22:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *   Then SystemInit() function is called, in "startup_stm32g4xx.s" file, to
  23:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *   configure the system clock before to branch to main program.
  24:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *
  25:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *   This file configures the system clock as follows:
  26:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *=============================================================================
  27:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  28:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *        System Clock source                    | HSI
  29:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  30:stm/stm32g4xx/system_stm32g4xx.c ****   *        SYSCLK(Hz)                             | 16000000
